// The deck: 20 planks of 1.1 x 0.4 m along a parabola with 1-cell gaps, so it
// hangs slack. Two iron bolts per plank put the wood under half its mass, so a
// plank never shatters on a jolt: only the hinges decide where the bridge fails.
// Every hinge but the centre one is unbreakable.
